function test_gen_marshal()
%TEST_GEN_MARSHAL  Call every generated subcommand once.
%
%   Runs with Init renderer 'null', so no GPU is needed. The test
%   checks that each generated subcommand accepts the argument
%   shapes the generator promised and returns outputs of the
%   promised size and class.
%
%   Generated by gen/generate.py from third_party/nanovg/src/nanovg.h.
%   Do not edit. Run `build.m gen` to regenerate.

